    card title "I can, I may, I must"

A: How do you say can, may and must in Russian?
    draw m_can_g m_may_g m_must_g

A: With three short words: могу́, мо́жно and ну́жно.
    draw m_can m_may m_must

    erase m_can m_can_g m_may m_may_g m_must m_must_g

A: Start with can. Я могу́ чита́ть по-ру́сски: I can read Russian, and so can you.
    draw i_book g_can

B: After могу́, a second verb comes straight from the dictionary, as after бу́ду.
    highlight g_can_w_3 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase i_book g_can

A: Its dictionary form, мочь, has no ть, so learn the forms by ear.
    draw h_moch

A: Я могу́, ты мо́жешь, он мо́жет: the endings of бу́ду, у, ешь, ет.
    draw f_ya f_ya_g f_ty f_ty_g f_on f_on_g

B: But the middle moves: г for я…
    highlight f_ya color #8a5fa8 effect glow part г

B: …and ж for ты and он: мо́жешь, мо́жет.
    highlight f_ty f_on color #8a5fa8 effect glow part ж

    quiz "Now guess: they can, они́ … ? Pick one." store chk voice b
        right: Take я могу́, add т, and the stress jumps forward: мо́гут.
        wrong: Start from я могу́ and add т, as бу́ду gives бу́дут; then stress мо: мо́гут.
        * мо́жут
        + мо́гут
        * мо́жат

A: Мы мо́жем, вы мо́жете, and они́ мо́гут: only я and они́ keep the г.
    draw f_my f_my_g f_vy f_vy_g f_oni f_oni_g

    highlight f_oni color #8a5fa8 effect glow part г duration 1.2

B: Не goes just before it: я не могу́, I can't.
    draw f_ne

    erase h_moch f_ya f_ya_g f_ty f_ty_g f_on f_on_g f_my f_my_g f_vy f_vy_g f_oni f_oni_g f_ne

A: May I is another word. At the café: мо́жно ко́фе, пожа́луйста? May I have a coffee?
    draw i_coffee g_may

B: Мо́жно means it's allowed, and it never changes.
    highlight g_may_w_1 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase g_may i_coffee

A: Alone, at a door, мо́жно? means may I come in?
    draw i_door t_door

B: The answer: мо́жно, yes, or нельзя́, no.
    draw i_yes t_yes t_yes_g i_no t_no t_no_g

    erase i_door t_door i_yes t_yes t_yes_g i_no t_no t_no_g

A: For who, add a to-word, as in мне нра́вится: мне мо́жно, а ему́ нельзя́.
    draw g_who

    erase g_who

A: Now must. Мне ну́жно рабо́тать: I have to work.
    draw g_need

A: Word for word: to me, it's needed, to work.
    highlight g_need_g_1 g_need_g_2 g_need_g_3 color #c9871a effect underline

B: So never я ну́жно: the need goes to you, like the years in мне два́дцать лет.
    draw x_ya x_strike

    erase x_ya x_strike

A: На́до means the same: мне на́до идти́, I have to go.
    draw g_nado

    erase g_need g_nado

B: So, two kinds. Могу́ is a verb, changing with the person: я могу́, ты мо́жешь, они́ мо́гут.
    draw s_lh s_l1 s_l2 s_l3

A: Мо́жно, нельзя́, ну́жно and на́до never change: the person goes in as a to-word, мне, тебе́, ему́ or вам.
    draw s_div s_rh s_r1 s_r2 s_r3 s_r4

    hide s_lh s_l1 s_l2 s_l3 s_div s_rh s_r1 s_r2 s_r3 s_r4

B: Now Tom asks me to the cinema.
    draw tom tom_name masha masha_name parallel true

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Ма́ша, мы идём в кино́. А ты? Ты мо́жешь?","gloss":"Masha, we're going to the cinema. And you? Can you?"},{"by":"b","text":"Сего́дня не могу́. Мне ну́жно рабо́тать.","gloss":"Not today, I can't. I have to work."},{"by":"a","text":"А за́втра?","gloss":"And tomorrow?"},{"by":"b","text":"За́втра могу́!","gloss":"Tomorrow I can!"},{"by":"b","text":"Мне на́до идти́. Пока́!","gloss":"I have to go. Bye!"}] size 1.3

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Не могу́, with no я, as in не зна́ю: могу́ already says who.
    highlight talk_2_words color #c9871a effect underline part "не могу́"

B: And why: мне ну́жно рабо́тать, the to-word, ну́жно, and a verb.
    highlight talk_2_words color #c9871a effect underline part "ну́жно рабо́тать"

    erase talk

    hide speakers

    icon t1_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["cinema","movie camera"] icon_look picture of "clapper board"

    quiz "Ask a friend if they can come: Ты … ? Which word fills the gap?" above t1_pic store q1 reveal.text "Ты мо́жешь?" reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Ты takes ешь, as in ты чита́ешь.
        wrong: Могу́ is for я and мо́гут for они́: ты needs ешь.
        * могу́
        * мо́гут
        + мо́жешь

    pause 1.2

    erase t1_pic q1_stamp

    icon t2_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["office building"] icon_look picture of briefcase

    quiz "Say I have to work. Pick one." above t2_pic store q2 reveal.text "Мне ну́жно рабо́тать." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: The need is given to you, so the to-word: мне.
        wrong: Ну́жно never takes я: the person goes in as мне.
        + Мне ну́жно рабо́тать.
        * Я ну́жно рабо́тать.
        * Я могу́ рабо́тать.

    pause 1.2

    erase t2_pic q2_stamp

    icon t3_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["coffee"] icon_look picture of "hot beverage"

    quiz "What does Мо́жно ко́фе? mean? Pick one." above t3_pic store q3 reveal.text "Мо́жно ко́фе?" reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Мо́жно asks if it's allowed: may I?
        wrong: Мо́жно asks if it's allowed: may I, not I'm able to or I must.
        * I can make coffee.
        * I have to drink coffee.
        + May I have a coffee?

    pause 1.2

    erase t3_pic q3_stamp

    icon t4_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["people holding hands","couple"] icon_look picture of "woman and man holding hands"

    quiz "Masha and her brother can't come today: Сего́дня они́ не … Which word fills the gap?" above t4_pic store q4 reveal.text "Сего́дня они́ не мо́гут." reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Они́ takes the г of могу́, plus т.
        wrong: For они́ the г comes back: я могу́, они́ мо́гут.
        * мо́жут
        + мо́гут
        * мо́жем

    pause 1.2

    erase t4_pic q4_stamp

    icon t5_pic size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["no entry"] icon_look picture of prohibited

    ask "No, not allowed: the opposite of мо́жно. Type it." above t5_pic answer ["нельзя"] store q5 default нельзя́ reveal.text Нельзя́! reveal.style label reveal.size 64 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Нельзя́: not allowed, and it never changes.
        wrong: The no to мо́жно is нельзя́.

    pause 1.2

    erase t5_pic q5_stamp

    show s_lh s_l1 s_l2 s_l3 s_div s_rh s_r1 s_r2 s_r3 s_r4

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So: я могу́ for can, мо́жно and нельзя́ for allowed or not, and мне ну́жно or на́до for must.
    highlight s_l1 s_r1 s_r2 s_r3 s_r4 color #c9871a effect underline

    erase s_lh s_l1 s_l2 s_l3 s_div s_rh s_r1 s_r2 s_r3 s_r4

B: And you? Вы мо́жете чита́ть по-ру́сски: you just did. Next time, coffee with milk. Пока́!
    icon e_book size 140 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["books","book"] icon_look picture of "open book"
    text e_line "Я могу́ чита́ть по-ру́сски!" #3d3833 say "Я могу́ чита́ть по-ру́сски!" say_voice a x 500 y 380 font_size 66

